## Maintaining Adequate Staffing Levels to Meet Operational Needs

The Department values its employees and understands they are its greatest asset. GTM has gone to great lengths to combat the many challenges the Department has faced since the hiring freeze that lasted from January 2017 through May 2018. GTM has:

 Conducted extensive recruitment to fill positions vacated during the freeze and those that were not successfully filled prior to the freeze;

 Effectively eliminated the Civil Service hiring backlog contributing to a net gain of 500 Civil Service hires and 13 months of uninterrupted growth in Civil Service hires;

